   "plain": "Tijuana's drinking water travels hundreds of kilometers from the Colorado River. Its sewage, when pipes fail or don't exist, runs down canyons into the Tijuana River, which crosses north into the United States and reaches the Pacific at Imperial Beach. The same infrastructure gap is felt on both sides of the wall, by very different neighbors.",
